msgid ""
"\" A perfect spot for great food. <br/>Cozy atmosphere, excellent service, "
"and delicious meals. \""
msgstr ""
" Popoln kraj za odlično hrano. <br/>Prijetno vzdušje, odlična postrežba in "
"okusne jedi. "

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_quotes_carousel_minimal
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\" Exceptional flavors and service! <br/>They made every dining experience "
"unforgettable. \""
msgstr ""
" Izjemni okusi in postrežba! <br/>Vsako kulinarično doživetje so naredili "
"nepozabno. "

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_quotes_carousel_minimal
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\" Their dishes are a delight. Fresh, flavorful, and beautifully presented. "
"\""
msgstr ""
" Njihove jedi so pravi užitek. Sveže, polnega okusa in čudovito postrežene. "

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_split_intro
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<br/>Indulge in a dining experience where flavor meets comfort. At our "
"bistro, we blend fresh ingredients with culinary creativity to offer a menu "
"that delights every palate. Whether you're here for a quick bite or a "
"leisurely meal, our welcoming atmosphere and delicious dishes make every "
"visit special.<br/><br/>"
msgstr ""
"<br/>Privoščite si kulinarično doživetje, kjer se okus sreča z udobjem. V "
"našem bistroju združujemo sveže sestavine s kulinarično ustvarjalnostjo in "
"ponujamo jedilnik, ki navduši vsak okus. Ne glede na to, ali ste pri nas na "
"hitrem prigrizku ali sproščenem obroku, naš prijeten ambient in okusne jedi "
"vsak obisk naredita nekaj posebnega.<br/><br/>\n"
"Lokacija: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_split_intro"

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_text_cover
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<br/>Showcase your bistro’s menu online with a user-friendly platform that "
"simplifies all the steps, from setup to menu management, making it easy for "
"guests to explore and enjoy your offerings.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<br/>Predstavite meni svojega bistroja na spletu z uporabniku prijazno "
"platformo, ki poenostavi vse korake, od nastavitve do upravljanja menija, "
"ter gostom olajša raziskovanje in uživanje v vaši ponudbi.<br/>"

#. module: theme_bistro
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bistro.s_empowerment
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<br/>Where every meal is a celebration of flavor and ambiance.<br/><br/>"
